    "What’s New…" : {

    },
    "What’s new in %@" : {

    },
    "When a display transition requires Thaw to apply a different menu bar spacing, Thaw relaunches apps with menu bar items. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost." : {
      "comment" : "A warning that a display transition requiring a different menu bar spacing relaunches menu bar apps, which can lose unsaved state.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When a display transition requires Thaw to apply a different menu bar spacing, Thaw relaunches apps with menu bar items. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a profile is active, choose whether spacing changes save to just the active profile or to every profile." : {
      "comment" : "Annotation for the profile-target picker shown when relaunch confirmations are disabled."
    },
    "When a profile is active, choose whether spacing changes save to the active profile or to every profile." : {

    },
    "When an app opens a thaw:// link to change settings, %@ checks whether you have allowed that app." : {

    },
    "When an app sends a thaw:// URL to change settings, Thaw checks whether you have allowed that app." : {
      "comment" : "A step in the process of how to use Thaw."
    },
    "When hidden items open on the menu bar, items kept to the %@ Bar appear in a small %@ Bar under it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When hidden items open on the menu bar, items kept to the %1$@ Bar appear in a small %2$@ Bar under it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the menu bar is full, move the Visible items that don’t fit into Hidden, so they stay reachable instead of going behind macOS’s » button." : {

    },
    "When you show hidden items, the items kept in the %@ Bar appear in a small %@ Bar below the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When you show hidden items, the items kept in the %1$@ Bar appear in a small %2$@ Bar below the menu bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the panel opens" : {

    },
    "Where the search panel opens" : {

    },
    "Where you left it" : {

    },
    "While an item is dragged into place, the pointer is hidden and your mouse input is held, then both come back." : {

    },
    "While an item is hidden, macOS does not draw it anywhere, so Thaw cannot see it either. Thaw captures a hidden item's icon only during the brief moment it reveals the item to fetch one." : {

    },
    "While rearranging" : {

    },
    "While the pointer rests on the menu bar, shows a blown-up view of the icons around it just below the bar. Each icon gets a large outline you can click to open the real one, and the icon you point at is named underneath. Needs Screen Recording to show the icons' pixels; the outlines and names work without it." : {

